### Production Deployment Notes
To enable Web Analytics in production:
1. Deploy this project to Vercel
2. Navigate to the Analytics section in the Vercel project dashboard
3. Click "Enable" to activate Web Analytics
4. Analytics will begin tracking page views and web vitals automatically

